{
    "_comment": [
        "RDMA loopback platform profiles for rdma_test_ipv4_v4.py / rdma_test_ipv6_v5.py.",
        "Select with --platform <name> (launcher: --params '6.platform=TTM'); 'default' is used otherwise.",
        "Per platform: 'pairs' is required ([server, client], named pair1..N in order).",
        "Optional (auto-detected when omitted — verify, then pin here):",
        "  cards     : {nic: BF3|CX8|CX7|CX6}        → sysfs device id / board_id / mst status",
        "  link_gbps : {card: Gb/s}                  → /sys/class/infiniband/<nic>/ports/1/rate",
        "  gpu_map   : {nic: 'DDDD:BB:DD.F'}         → same-NUMA GPU; server/client on different GPUs",
        "  waves     : [[pairN, ...], ...]           → ports of the same physical card never share a wave",
        "  line_rate_pct : threshold = link_gbps x pct (default 0.90)",
        "  card_behavior : {card: {rdma_cm: bool, data_direct: bool}} to override built-in behaviour",
        "Cross-card interference (e.g. L10: BF3 + NUMA1 CX8) cannot be auto-detected; measure, then set 'waves'."
